### Ingestar una liga especifica (La Liga, temporada 2024)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/ingest/140?season=2024

###

### Ingestar Premier League
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/ingest/39?season=2024

###

### Ingestar Bundesliga
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/ingest/78?season=2024

###

### Ingestar Serie A
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/ingest/135?season=2024

###

### Ingestar Ligue 1
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/ingest/61?season=2024

###

### Ingestar Champions League
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/ingest/2?season=2024

###

### Ingestar todas las ligas configuradas
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/ingest-all?season=2024

###

### Enriquecer con FBref — La Liga
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/enrich-fbref/1?competition_name=La%20Liga&season=2024

###

### Enriquecer con FBref — Premier League
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/enrich-fbref/2?competition_name=Premier%20League&season=2024

###

### Enriquecer con FBref — Champions League
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/enrich-fbref/3?competition_name=Champions%20League&season=2024

###

### Enriquecer con Understat — La Liga
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/enrich-understat/1?competition_name=La%20Liga&season=2024&season_int=2024

###

### Enriquecer con Understat — Premier League
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/enrich-understat/2?competition_name=Premier%20League&season=2024&season_int=2024

###

### Enriquecimiento completo de todas las ligas (FBref + Understat + Recalculo)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/enrich-all?season=2024&season_int=2024

###

### Recalcular scores — La Liga (util despues de cambiar parametros de scoring)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/recalculate/1?season=2024

###

### Recalcular scores — Premier League
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/recalculate/2?season=2024

###

### Ver logs de ingestion (pendiente implementacion)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/ingestion-logs
